        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7054BL, Clear Crystal Bristol Knobset with Modern #3 Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bristol Clear Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose is so easy to install on most predrilled doors. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This clear crystal knobset has a sandcast bronze rosette that is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Clear Crystal Bristol Knobset with Modern #3 Rose is a great choice for rural homes that still want to display a modern side. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Bristol Crystal Ball Knob with Rectangle Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bristol Knobset with Sandcast Bronze Rectangular Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Steam: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bristol Clear Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Bristol Clear Crystal Knob with Rectangular Rose is so easy to install on most predrilled doors. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This clear crystal knobset has a sandcast bronze rosette that is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Clear Crystal Bristol Knobset with Modern #3 Rose is a great choice for rural homes that still want to display a modern side. \r\n",
